Every clinician should collaborate with a patient during a treatment-decision.
Every clinician should collaborate with a patient during a treatment-plan-design.
Every clinician should collaborate with a patient during a pain-management-strategy-initiation.
Every clinician should collaborate with a patient during a pain-management-strategy-change.
If a clinician considers an opioid-initiation for a patient then the clinician should particularly collaborate with the patient.
If a clinician considers an opioid-dosage-increase for a patient then the clinician should particularly collaborate with the patient.
If a clinician considers an opioid-taper for a patient then the clinician should particularly collaborate with the patient.
If a clinician considers an opioid-discontinuation for a patient then the clinician should particularly collaborate with the patient.
